(text "DDR POWER — LPDDR4X 1×32-bit target" (at 40 35 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000004b"))
(text "VCC_DDR_1V1 comes from RK809-5 BUCK3; this page adds the separate 0.6V and 1.8V rails required by LPDDR4X." (at 40 48 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000004c"))
(text "SY8089AAAC: 2A synchronous buck, 2.2uH, 10uF input, 2×22uF output. FB tied directly to VOUT for the 0.6V reference." (at 40 62 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000004d"))
(text "AP2112K-1.8TRG1: 600mA LDO from VCC3V3_PMU; upstream PMIC LDO6 is limited to 400mA, so verify combined PMUIO + DDR VDD1 current." (at 40 76 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000004e"))
(text "LPDDR4X rail order target: VCC1V8_DDR → VCC_DDR_1V1 → VCC0V6_DDR. Confirm ramp timing and current against selected DRAM datasheet and Rockchip DDR template." (at 40 90 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000004f"))
